Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:22:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui_gateway): isolate pending replay custody by exact
 profile [daveey]

Keep profile identity through local coalescing, timer wake, Stop and retirement handoff. Cancel carried local work only through the successful context start watermark. Proof: four regressions failed on base, 58 focused tests pass, four guard mutants killed.
